</use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10144.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"B0\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-B0\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10644.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(11311.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(12367.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(13089.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(14089.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(15367.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(16423.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(17423.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p><b>Calculate the power (P) at t = 10 s:</b><br><br>\nThe power (P) can be calculated as the product of force (F) and velocity (v):\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28.445ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 12572.8 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xl