anslate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(10944.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"57\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-57\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nSo, the power delivered by the pulling force at t = 10 s from the start is 300 W.</p>","qKey":"1lgsxpbkt","paperKey":"jee-main-2023-online-11th-april-evening-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}